@startuml DFD_Level2_P3
title **LEVEL 2 — Process 3: Log Attendance & GPS**

skinparam backgroundColor White
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam arrowColor #1F2937
skinparam arrowThickness 1.2
skinparam arrowFontSize 8

skinparam rectangle<<ent>> {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  RoundCorner 0
  FontStyle bold
  FontSize 11
}
skinparam rectangle<<proc>> {
  BackgroundColor #DBEAFE
  BorderColor #2563EB
  RoundCorner 12
  FontStyle bold
  FontSize 10
}
skinparam rectangle<<ds>> {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  RoundCorner 0
  FontSize 9
}

top to bottom direction

rectangle "Student" as STU <<ent>>
rectangle "Teacher" as TCH <<ent>>
rectangle "Parent"  as PAR <<ent>>

rectangle "3.1\nScan Student\nIdentity QR Code"                       as P31 <<proc>>
rectangle "3.2\nCapture GPS\nLocation\n(Background, 5s Heartbeat)"    as P32 <<proc>>
rectangle "3.3\nVerify Attendance\nData"                              as P33 <<proc>>
rectangle "3.4\nStore Attendance\nRecord"                             as P34 <<proc>>
rectangle "3.5\nProvide Attendance\nStatus"                           as P35 <<proc>>

rectangle "D1  |  Trip Details"                  as D1 <<ds>>
rectangle "D2  |  Student & Parent Information"  as D2 <<ds>>
rectangle "D3  |  Attendance Records"            as D3 <<ds>>
rectangle "D6  |  GPS Location Data"             as D6 <<ds>>

STU --> P31 : QR code display\n(static identity QR)
P31 --> P33 : scanned student ID
STU --> P32 : GPS coordinates\n(background service)
P32 --> D6  : GPS location data
D1  --> P33 : trip schedule & stop data
D2  --> P33 : student profile data
P33 --> P34 : validated attendance entry
P34 --> D3  : attendance log\n(QR + GPS + timestamp)
D3  --> P35 : attendance data
P35 --> TCH : attendance status update\n(present/absent per stop)
D6  --> PAR : live GPS data of child

@enduml
